# MixAuto dashboard layout, dock, panels, onboarding, app drawer

## Agent front matter

**Owners:** `DashboardScreen.kt`, `DashboardScreenEffects.kt`, `DashboardPanelActions.kt`, `DashboardLayouts.kt`, `DashboardLayoutProps.kt`, `LauncherViewModel.kt`, `LauncherMapPrefs.kt`, `LauncherAudioPrefs.kt`, `LauncherPreferences.kt`, `ui/components/*` overlays (search, POI detail, settings).

**Common tasks:** portrait/landscape layout, map/media divider, `activePanel` overlays (40% map split), destination search session state, onboarding wizard.

**Anti-patterns:** `remember` for rotation-sensitive panel state (use `LauncherViewModel`); missing `CarLabelText` / `Car*Text` imports; putting map settings in top-right toolbar stack.

## Dashboard layout

- `DashboardScreen.kt`: portrait Column (map → media → horizontal dock) or landscape Row/Column; map via `CarMapViewContainer` | media + shortcuts; `mapMediaRatio` slider in settings (default 0.6)
- `MainActivity` uses `WindowCompat.setDecorFitsSystemWindows(window, false)` + `WindowInsetsControllerCompat.show(systemBars())` — root `DashboardScreen` must apply `systemBarsPadding()` so content sits below status/nav bars; head units with zero insets get no extra padding
- Do **not** set `android:windowFullscreen` in `themes.xml` — it hides the system status/notification bar on Eonon head units; keep `windowContentOverlay` @null only
- Portrait: map `weight(mapMediaRatio)`, media `weight(1 - ratio)`, horizontal `ShortcutDock` at bottom with wrap-content height
- Landscape horizontal shortcuts: map/media split by `mapMediaRatio`; vertical shortcuts: narrow icon-only dock (`wrapContentWidth()`), map/media share remaining Row width by ratio
- Horizontal dock compact sizes: `DockHorizontalTapTarget` 48dp, `DockHorizontalIconSize` 40dp — do not reuse `MinTapTarget`/`AppIconSize` for horizontal bar
- `LauncherViewModel.updateMapMediaRatio()` not `setMapMediaRatio()` — JVM signature clash with `mapMediaRatio` property setter. Driving/traffic/voice/puck/TomTom pref bodies live in `LauncherMapPrefs`; default-player/resume/album-art bodies in `LauncherAudioPrefs`. ViewModel keeps the public API and forwards; do not grow those setter bodies back onto the ViewModel.
- Missing import for `CarLabelText` in `DashboardScreen.kt` caused compile failure — always import all `Car*Text` composables used in a file
- Shared overlay dismiss: `OverlayCloseButton` in `ui/components/` — use for full-screen dialogs (settings, search), not text Close buttons
- Map/media split: draggable 3-dot `MapMediaDividerHandle` on pane seam in `DashboardScreen.kt` (not Settings slider); ratio 0.3–0.8 persisted via `LauncherPreferences.mapMediaRatio` / `LauncherViewModel.updateMapMediaRatio()`
- Overlay split lock: when `activePanel == ActivePanel.SEARCH`, `ActivePanel.ADD_PLACE`, `ActivePanel.POI_DETAIL`, `ActivePanel.MAP_DATA`, `ActivePanel.ROUTE_PICKER`, or `ActivePanel.AUDIO_SETTINGS`, use `effectiveMapMediaRatio = OVERLAY_MAP_MEDIA_RATIO` (**0.4f** — 40% map / 60% secondary) for layout weights and hide divider via `showMapMediaDivider`; do NOT call `updateMapMediaRatio(0.4f)` — persisted ratio unchanged so dismiss restores user's prior split; Settings / App Drawer / Media unaffected
- Map tap dismiss handler (`LaunchedEffect(activePanel)` in `DashboardScreenEffects.kt`): `ADD_PLACE` → custom handler; `POI_DETAIL` → dismiss POI; `SEARCH`, `MAP_DATA`, `AUDIO_SETTINGS` → `onDismissPanel`; else clear handler
- Map/media divider drag: never put `mapMediaRatio` in `pointerInput` keys — each ratio update restarts the detector and breaks continuous drag; use `rememberUpdatedState` + `onDragStart` + accumulated `totalDragPx`
- Map/media divider touch target: do not use `MinTapTarget` as layout width/height in Row/Column — use `seamTouchTarget` layout modifier (0 dp seam, 64 dp hit area placed centered overlapping panes); RHD horizontal shortcuts need `invertDrag = true`
- Settings panel in media pane: `SettingsContent` composable root must be `Surface(color = OledBlack)` — without it, `LocalContentColor` defaults to black and all `Text` composables become invisible against the dark background; `MediaOrSettingsPane` composable conditionally renders either `MediaPlayerPane` or `SettingsContent` to avoid a full-screen dialog
- Custom scrollbars: `ui/components/CarScrollbarModifier.kt` — `carScrollbar(ScrollState)` for `verticalScroll` Column; `carLazyScrollbar(LazyListState)` for `LazyColumn`; apply on fixed viewport (`Surface`/`Box`), not the scrolling child; thumb = `ElectricCyan` 4dp, always visible when overflow; M3 `Modifier.scrollbar` unavailable on BOM 2024.06.00 (M3 1.2.1)
- Settings scroll: `SettingsContent` hoists `rememberScrollState()`, `.carScrollbar(scrollState)` on `Surface`, Column uses same state for `verticalScroll`
- `SettingsSwitchRow` in `DashboardScreen.kt` accepts optional `enabled: Boolean = true` — when false, applies `Modifier.alpha(0.38f)` on the Row and passes `enabled = false` to `Switch`; import `androidx.compose.ui.draw.alpha`
- First-launch defaults in `LauncherPreferences.kt` (SharedPreferences fallback when key absent): horizontal shortcuts ON (`isShortcutsHorizontal`), large shortcut icons ON, vector tiles ON, 3D buildings OFF; existing installs keep saved prefs — clear app data to re-test defaults
- **Panel state across rotation:** `LauncherViewModel.activePanel` + `poiReturnToSearch` (not `remember` in `DashboardScreen`); mutate via `setActivePanel()` / `setPoiReturnToSearch()` / `clearPoiReturnToSearch()`
- **Destination search session:** `LauncherViewModel.destinationSearchState` (`DestinationSearchUiState` — query, results, nearby, snapshot origin, `hasSearched`, `savedFilterActive`, `isSearching`, `isLoadingRemote`); `NavigationSearchContent` uses `updateDestinationSearch()`; **`clearDestinationSearchState()`** on search dismiss (`onDismissPanel` / search toggle close); preserve when POI preview → return-to-search (`poiReturnToSearch`); origin snapshot set once per session (`snapshotOriginLat == null` guard in `LaunchedEffect(Unit)`); typed search sets `isSearching`/`isLoadingRemote` **before** debounce — do NOT clear `results` on re-query (keep prior rows while updating); only show **No results found** when both loading flags are false; cancelled search `finally` must not clear flags (`coroutineContext.isActive` guard)

## Shortcut dock

- `ShortcutDock.kt`: three-zone dock — driver cluster (App Drawer + **Voice Search mic**) | centered **pinned apps (up to 5)** | **music side control** (`DockMusicSideControl`: horizontal track text / vertical `DockMiniVisualizer` when collapsed, cyan MusicNote when media pane open); **Launcher settings** gear in `AppDrawerOverlay` header; Map Data on map toolbar only; `ActivePanel.APP_DRAWER` opens `AppDrawerOverlay` over map+media only (shortcut bar stays visible)
- `ShortcutDock` item keys must stay stable (`voice_search`, `app_drawer`, `dock_music_control`, `dock_pinned_$packageName`); wrap horizontal/vertical branches in `key(isHorizontal, isLeftHandDrive)` — toggling layout or LHD changes icon order and can crash with duplicate keys
- Shortcut icon size: `DockShortcutIconSize` enum (`SMALL`/`MEDIUM`/`LARGE`) in `ShortcutDock.kt`; persisted via `LauncherPreferences.dockShortcutIconSize` (key `shortcut_icon_size`, ordinal 0/1/2, default **LARGE** on first launch); legacy `large_shortcut_icons` boolean migrates on read (false→SMALL, true→LARGE); Settings **Shortcut Icon Size** discrete slider (`valueRange` 0..2, `steps = 1`); scales `DockHorizontalTapTarget`/`DockHorizontalIconSize` by 1×/1.5×/2× — do not use `AppIconSize` for dock items
- Music player access: dock **`DockMusicSideControl`** toggles `ActivePanel.MEDIA`; **horizontal collapsed** = marquee title/artist over faint **`DockMiniVisualizer(wide = true, barCount = 32, barAlpha = 0.22f)`** — **LHD right-aligned** (`CenterEnd`, `TextAlign.End`); **RHD left-aligned** (`CenterStart`, `TextAlign.Start`); **horizontal open** / **vertical** = icon-sized **`DockMiniVisualizer`** (default 6 thick bars, `wide = false`); fixed **`DOCK_MUSIC_SLOT_WIDTH = 280.dp`** — do NOT use `widthIn(max=…)` or variable open-state width on horizontal slot
- Dock music side control: horizontal slot fixed `DOCK_MUSIC_SLOT_WIDTH = 280.dp`; collapsed title uses `DockMiniVisualizer(wide = true)` for full-width background bars; icon open/vertical slots use default thick `DOCK` layout — do NOT share one bar-layout path for both
- Launcher settings: **Settings** gear in `AppDrawerOverlay` header → `onOpenLauncherSettings` → `activePanel = ActivePanel.SETTINGS` (replaces app drawer); overflow MoreVert menu removed
- Pinned audio apps: `MusicNote` badge at `BottomEnd` scaled to dock icon — `badgeSize = iconSize * 0.55f`, `badgeIconSize = iconSize * 0.35f` (cyan when `defaultAudioPackage`); non-audio pinned apps tap launch via `launchAppByPackage()`; **active** pinned audio tap toggles media pane via `DashboardPanelActions.handleSelectAudioSource()` (matches `sourcePackage` when session active, else `defaultAudioPackage`); app drawer uses `openAudioSource` (always set + open, no toggle)
- Panel toggle system: `ActivePanel` enum in `ShortcutDock.kt` (`MEDIA`, `SETTINGS`, `MAP_DATA`, `APP_DRAWER`, `SEARCH`, `POI_DETAIL`, `ROUTE_PICKER`, `AUDIO_SETTINGS`, `HIDDEN`); **radio-style dock indicators** on App Drawer only (not horizontal music control); `musicPaneEnabled` persisted in `LauncherPreferences` (key `music_pane_enabled`, default **true**) via `LauncherViewModel.updateMusicPaneEnabled()` — gates `dismissToBasePanel()` (`HIDDEN` vs `MEDIA`) and cold-start `activePanel` init in `DashboardScreen`; do NOT set `updateMusicPaneEnabled(true)` when opening nav overlays (search, map settings, voice search, POI preview/select, route picker) — only explicit music actions (`onTogglePanel(MEDIA)`, `handleSelectAudioSource`, `openAudioSource` in `DashboardPanelActions`) should restore the pane; music side control → `ActivePanel.MEDIA` toggle; **horizontal dock layout**: full-width `Box` — `CenterDockCluster` at `Alignment.Center` (true screen center), `DriverSideCluster` + `DockMusicSideControl` overlaid at start/end (draw side clusters **after** center for z-order/taps); do NOT use `Row` + `weight(1f)` middle column — 280 dp music slot vs ~2-icon driver cluster skews pinned icons left; vertical LHD = drawer+mic top, vertical RHD = mic+drawer top | pinned center | music control bottom; `DriverSideCluster(isLeftHandDrive)` gates icon order — do NOT hardcode drawer-before-mic for all layouts; Map Data renders inline via `MapDataPanelContent` from map toolbar, not dock
- Horizontal pinned dock icons off-center: `Row` + `weight(1f)` center column centers icons in the gap between driver cluster and 280 dp music slot, not the full dock — use full-width `Box` with `CenterDockCluster` at `Alignment.Center` and edge clusters overlaid (`ShortcutDock.kt`)
- Vertical shortcut dock (landscape): icon-only — no "Shortcuts" header or per-item labels; `ElevatedCard` uses `wrapContentWidth()` not full column width; `DashboardScreen` uses `.wrapContentWidth().fillMaxHeight()` not `.weight(DockVerticalWeight)` — map/media fill remaining Row space; landscape weights use `mapMediaRatio` / `(1 - mapMediaRatio)` directly; divider container = row width minus measured `verticalDockWidthPx`
- Vertical dock sizing must match horizontal: `ShortcutDock` `shortcutIconSize` scales `DockHorizontalTapTarget` + `DockHorizontalIconSize` (1×/1.5×/2×) for both orientations — do not use `AppIconSize` / `MinTapTarget` for vertical items
- Dock pinned shortcuts: `LauncherPreferences.dockPinnedPackages` JSON list (key `dock_pinned_packages`, max **5** via `MAX_DOCK_PINNED_APPS`); `LauncherViewModel.toggleDockPinnedPackage()` append/remove, validates with `canLaunchApp()` on load, no-op for own package (`BuildConfig.APPLICATION_ID`); flow MainActivity → DashboardScreen → `ShortcutDock` + `AppDrawerOverlay`
- Pinned apps render in `CenterDockCluster` only (no Music icon); stable keys `dock_pinned_$packageName`; audio apps tap → `handleSelectAudioSource` (toggle if already active source), others tap → `launchAppByPackage()`; long-press uses shared `AppContextDropdownMenu` in `ui/components/AppContextMenu.kt` (Add/Remove shortcut bar, App Info, Uninstall); Add disabled when list full (`canAddToDock = isPinned || size < max`)
- Pinned dock long-press menu: upward offset like overflow — `DOCK_APP_MENU_ESTIMATED_HEIGHT = 168.dp` (3 items), anchor `wrapContentSize(unbounded = true)`; drawer uses default downward menu
- Destination panel active affordance: `isDestinationPanelOpen = activePanel == SEARCH || POI_DETAIL` — **map search button only** uses inverted active colors (cyan background, `OledBlack` icon); dock mic has **no active styling** (always primary tint, no `DockActiveIndicator`) — action-only shortcut
- Voice search dock shortcut: `ShortcutDock` mic → `onVoiceSearch()`; `NavigationSearchContent` sets `RecognitionListener` once in `DisposableEffect`; **first** mic press calls `startListening()` directly + `SpeechSearchAudioFocus` (`AUDIOFOCUS_GAIN_TRANSIENT_MAY_DUCK`); **consecutive** press when `recognizerSessionActive` uses `cancel()` → `onError` → `startListening()` (busy-session fix); do NOT use cancel-only on idle recognizer (Eonon may never fire `onError` → no system mic indicator, no music duck); log `onError` codes under tag `NavigationSearchOverlay`
- Mic listening stops immediately on consecutive dock-mic presses: do not call `startListening()` directly when UI `isListening` is already false — always cancel-then-restart via `pendingVoiceRestart` + `onError` callback; also check for Gemini holding the speech engine and mic permission
- Destination voice search: Eonon hardware voice button dispatches `KEYCODE_VOICE_ASSIST` (fallback `KEYCODE_SEARCH`) — `MainActivity.onKeyDown()` consumes only when `LauncherViewModel.isDestinationSearchOpen`; on Gemini-wired head units the key often never reaches the app — use **dock mic shortcut** instead; in-overlay mic trailing icon in `NavigationSearchOverlay` is secondary; requires `RECORD_AUDIO` + `SpeechRecognizer.isRecognitionAvailable()`; hide dock mic and overlay mic when recognizer unavailable

## App drawer

- App Drawer overlay: `AppDrawerOverlay.kt` — `PackageManager.queryIntentActivities(ACTION_MAIN/CATEGORY_LAUNCHER)` sorted by label; search filter; tap launch; long-press dropdown App Info / Uninstall; `DashboardScreen` `SplitScreenAppDrawerSlot` overlays **map+media Box only** — do NOT wrap vertical `ShortcutDock` in a Column with drawer above it (malforms dock: floating icons, black gap); vertical dock stays `wrapContentWidth().fillMaxHeight()` sibling of weighted map/media `Box`
- App Drawer long-press menu: `DropdownMenu` must live inside each `AppDrawerItem`'s anchor `Box` with local `showMenu` state — do NOT hoist to `Surface` root (no anchor → popup at top-left); anchor `Box` uses `Modifier.fillMaxWidth()` only — do NOT add `wrapContentSize(unbounded = true)` (copied from dock overflow); that shrink-wraps lazy grid cells to icon width and hides `CarLabelText` with `weight(1f)`
- App Drawer missing Google/system apps (Android 11+): `queryIntentActivities` with flag `0` silently omits apps due to package visibility restrictions — fix requires BOTH (1) `<queries><intent><action android:name="android.intent.action.MAIN"/><category android:name="android.intent.category.LAUNCHER"/></intent></queries>` block in `AndroidManifest.xml` AND (2) flag `PackageManager.MATCH_ALL` in `loadLaunchableApps()` in `AppDrawerOverlay.kt`
- App drawer open lag: `LaunchableAppsRepository` loads launcher metadata (label + intent, no icons) on `Dispatchers.Default`; `LauncherViewModel.ensureLaunchableAppsLoaded()` preloads in `init` and caches for process lifetime; `AppDrawerOverlay` uses `rememberAppIcon(packageName)` per visible row — do NOT call `queryIntentActivities` + rasterize every icon synchronously in composable `remember` on each open
- App drawer list excludes own package (`LaunchableAppsRepository` filters `context.packageName`); `loadValidatedDockPinnedPackages()` and `toggleDockPinnedPackage()` reject `BuildConfig.APPLICATION_ID` — Mix Auto must not appear in drawer or shortcut bar
- App drawer overlay layout: `SplitScreenAppDrawerSlot` uses `Modifier.fillMaxSize().zIndex(1f)` only — **no outer `.padding(PaneGap)`** on overlay modifier; outer padding shrinks the `Surface` and leaves a transparent margin where the map bleeds through at the top; inner content padding = `horizontal PaneGap * 2`, `vertical PaneGap / 2` (same as destination search)

## Panel headers / drawers / scroll

- Panel drawer headers: use shared `PanelHeaderRow` in `ui/components/PanelHeaderRow.kt` — do NOT duplicate `Row` + `CarHeadlineText` + `OverlayCloseButton`; settings gear in App Drawer uses `PanelHeaderIconButton` in `trailingContent`
- Panel header sizing tokens in `CarDimensions.kt`: `PanelHeaderTapTarget` 48 dp / `PanelHeaderIconSize` 32 dp (standard); `PanelCompactHeaderTapTarget` 40 dp / `PanelCompactHeaderIconSize` 28 dp — `OverlayCloseButton` uses these, not `MinTapTarget` (64 dp)
- `PanelHeaderRow(compact = true)` → `titleMedium` + compact close button; use on Destination Search, Map Settings, and **Route Picker** (`RoutePickerPane.kt`); panel padding `vertical = PaneGap / 2`
- Destination search field: do NOT set `.height(PrimaryTapTarget + PaneGap)` (92 dp) or floating `label` — use placeholder `"Destination"` only (matches App Drawer search pattern); panel Column uses `PaneGap` spacing not `DockItemSpacing`
- Panel root padding: prefer `.padding(horizontal = PaneGap * 2, vertical = PaneGap / 2)` on map/search/settings overlays — not symmetric `PaneGap * 2` on all sides
- Destination search scroll: `NavigationSearchOverlay` wraps suggestion/saved and typed-result `LazyColumn`s in `Box` with `.carLazyScrollbar(listState)`; shared `rememberLazyListState()` across mutually exclusive branches

## Destination search UI / saved places / add place from link

- Recent destinations: `LauncherPreferences.recentDestinations` JSON (max 10, 50 m dedup); `LauncherViewModel.addRecentDestination()`; wired MainActivity → DashboardScreen → CarMapViewContainer → NavigationSearchOverlay via `onDestinationSelected`
- Saved places: `LauncherPreferences.savedPlaces` JSON (max 50, 50 m dedup); `LauncherViewModel.toggleSavedPlace()` / `isPlaceSaved()`; wired MainActivity → DashboardScreen → CarMapViewContainer → NavigationSearchOverlay via `onToggleSavedPlace`
- POI details drawer: `PoiDetailDrawer.kt` rendered at **DashboardScreen** root `Box` (full screen, covers media pane) — not inside `CarMapViewContainer`; Navigate calls `onDestinationSelected` + `navigateToCoordinates`; star calls `onToggleSavedPlace`
- Empty search overlay: **Recent + Nearby** suggestions when `query.length < 2`; header star toggle (`savedFilterActive`) shows saved-only list and local text filter when typed; each `SearchResultRow` has star `IconButton`; typed normal-mode results also show star button
- Destination search saved filter: `savedFilterActive` in `NavigationSearchOverlay.kt` — star in `PanelHeaderRow.trailingContent` (`PanelCompactHeaderTapTarget` sizing); **+** icon beside star opens `ActivePanel.ADD_PLACE` (`AddPlaceFromLinkContent`); when ON, `filterSavedPlaces()` filters `displayedSaved` locally (name/subTitle, case-insensitive) — do NOT call `searchDestination` or `getNearbyPois`; progress bar gated with `!savedFilterActive`; placeholder `"Search saved places"`; toggle is ephemeral `remember` (resets when panel remounts)
- Destination search toggle: map search icon uses `onToggleSearch` + `isDestinationPanelOpen` from `DashboardScreen` — tap opens `ActivePanel.SEARCH`, tap again (or when POI detail open) dismisses search or `dismissSelectedPoi()`; active = inverted cyan bg + black search icon
- Destination search copy: no Point A/B labels — field label is **Destination** only (`NavigationSearchOverlay.kt`)
- Voice destination search: set `query` from `onResults` only — do NOT set query in `onPartialResults` (avoids premature typed-search while speaking)
- Destination search POI preview: `NavigationSearchContent.onPreviewPlace` → `DashboardScreen.onPreviewSearchPlace` sets `ActivePanel.POI_DETAIL` synchronously — do NOT call `onDismiss()` after `focusOnPoi()` (brief MEDIA panel + lazy padding breaks tile load)
- POI detail pane (`PoiDetailPane` in media pane, `ActivePanel.POI_DETAIL`): **one close only** — header `OverlayCloseButton` in `PoiDetailDrawer.kt`; action row is Navigate + Star only; do NOT add a second Close in `PoiDetailCardContent`
- POI dismiss return-to-search: `poiReturnToSearch` in `DashboardScreen.kt` set `true` in `onPreviewSearchPlace`; cleared via `onClearPoiReturnToSearch()` before Navigate; `LaunchedEffect(mapUiState.selectedPoi)` in `DashboardScreenEffects.kt` when `selectedPoi` null + panel is `POI_DETAIL` → `ActivePanel.SEARCH` if flag set else `dismissToBasePanel()`; all `dismissSelectedPoi()` paths (header X, map search toggle while POI open, etc.) inherit this via the same effect
- Search query/results not preserved when closing POI back to search — `NavigationSearchOverlay` query is local `remember` and remounts empty; hoist to `LauncherViewModel` only if UX requires preserving typed results
- **Add place from Google Maps link:** Destination Search header **+** → `ActivePanel.ADD_PLACE` + `AddPlaceFromLinkContent`; paste `maps.app.goo.gl` / `google.com/maps` link or plain `lat, lng`; `GoogleMapsLinkParser.resolve()` on IO expands short URLs (`HttpURLConnection` + `User-Agent: MixAutoCarLauncher/1.0`) — parse expanded URL then **response body** (up to 256 KB) when redirect is place-ID-only; coord patterns: `@lat,lng`, `q=` / `query=`, `ll=`, `geo:`, plain lat/lng, protobuf `!3d!4d` and `!3d`+`!2d`/`!4d` (URL-decode + `&amp;` normalize first) — no Google API; name from redirect `/maps/place/Name/` via `enrichWithRedirectPlaceName()` when body supplies coords; Confirm success → `onPreviewSearchPlace` with `isDroppedPin=true` → `POI_DETAIL` + `poiReturnToSearch`; Close (X) → `SEARCH`; state in `LauncherViewModel.addPlaceLinkState` (`clearAddPlaceLinkState` on dismiss/success); block Confirm when `isNavigating`; include `ADD_PLACE` in `isDestinationPanelOpen` and `onToggleSearch` dismiss path; v1 paste-only — no `ACTION_SEND` share target
- **Mobile goo.gl share links:** app-shared `maps.app.goo.gl` often redirects to `/maps/place/Name/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x…:0x…` with **no** `@lat,lng` — coords live in HTML preview `pb=` as `%213dLAT` / `%212dLNG`; do not rely on redirect URL alone; filter `!1d` altitude junk by valid lat/lng ranges; tests in `GoogleMapsLinkParserTest.kt`
- **Add Place pin name parsing:** `GoogleMapsLinkParser.formatPlaceDisplayName()` — `+` → space, `URLDecoder.decode`, strip remaining `+` from `%2B`, then `primaryPlaceName()` (first segment before comma); also reads `q=` via `QUERY_PLACE_NAME_REGEX` in preview HTML; `enrichWithRedirectPlaceName()` must always normalize existing `suggestedName` — do not early-return raw encoded text
- **Add Place / Custom Pin map tap dismiss:** `DashboardScreenEffects` `LaunchedEffect(activePanel)` — `ADD_PLACE` → `onDismissAddPlacePanel`, `POI_DETAIL` → `dismissSelectedPoi()` via `setMapTapDismissHandler`; empty map tap consumes handler before `handleMapPointSelection`
- **Pin name field UX:** dropped-pin `OutlinedTextField` in `PoiDetailDrawer.kt` — trailing `Icons.Filled.Clear` when non-empty; label **Pin name**

## Status strip

- Dashboard status strip: `DashboardStatusBar` in `ui/components/` at top of `DashboardScreen` root `Column` (above weighted map/media/dock `Box`); toggles `LauncherPreferences.showStatusStrip` / `showSystemStatusBar` (keys `show_status_strip`, `show_system_status_bar`, default **true**) in Launcher Settings; `MainActivity.applySystemBarVisibility()` + `SideEffect` + `onResume` for system bar hide (`BEHAVIOR_SHOW_TRANSIENT_BARS_BY_SWIPE` when hidden); conditional `systemBarsPadding()` on Column only when system bar shown
- Status strip layout: single `Row` in `DashboardStatusBar.kt` — **traffic reel** `weight(1f)` left (marquee via `basicMarquee` in clipped `Box`) | `StatusStripTrafficReelGap` **28dp** | time·date | `StatusStripTimeWeatherGap` **20dp** | Nominatim city + weather right; do NOT center clock over traffic with overlapping `Box`
- Status strip traffic reel: `TomTomTrafficClient.fetchNearbyIncidents()` → TomTom Orbis **Incident Details** (`iconCategories=jam,accident`, ~0.12° bbox); `StatusBarViewModel.refreshTraffic()` every **3 min** when overlay+key+GPS; cycles up to **5** headlines every **6 s**; skip road closed/lane closed/road works — format `Heavy traffic › {street}` / `Medium traffic › …` / `Light traffic › …`; empty → green **No major traffic detected**; `TrafficFlowLevel` + `TrafficFlowFree/Light/Moderate/Heavy` in `Color.kt`; dedupe same street (keep worst level); collapse redundant from→to names
- Status strip padding: `StatusStripPaddingTop` **1dp**, `StatusStripPaddingHorizontal` **12dp**, **no bottom padding** on strip; text uses `PlatformTextStyle(includeFontPadding = false)`; gap to split view closed via `StatusStripAdjacentGap` (**0dp**) + `reduceTopInset` on `CarMapViewContainer` (when `showStatusStrip`) and `MediaPlayerPane` (when `showStatusStrip && !isPortrait` only — portrait media sits below map, not under strip)
- Status strip text color: `DashboardStatusBar` root must be `Surface(color = OledBlack, contentColor = OnDark)` — bare `Modifier.background(OledBlack)` leaves `LocalContentColor` black and clock invisible (same bug as `SettingsContent`)
- Status strip data: weather `OpenMeteoClient` + `StatusBarViewModel.refreshWeather(lat,lng)` from `MapUiState.currentLat/currentLng`; city `NominatimReverseGeocodeClient.fetchCityName()` (city→town→municipality keys, 1h cache, User-Agent `MixAutoCarLauncher/1.0`); weather fetch skipped when strip composable not composed (`showStatusStrip` false)
- Status strip traffic reel truncation: reel uses `basicMarquee` — do not re-add `MAX_HEADLINE_CHARS` client truncation or `TextOverflow.Ellipsis` on the reel; keep `StatusStripTrafficReelGap` so clock/weather don't steal width

## Onboarding

- Permission onboarding wizard: `ui/onboarding/OnboardingWizard.kt` + `LauncherPreferences.onboardingVersion` (key `onboarding_version`, default 0); `CURRENT_ONBOARDING_VERSION = 1`; on launch if stored version < current, show full-screen wizard over `DashboardScreen` with steps filtered by `sinceVersion > onboardingVersion`; on complete persist `onboardingVersion = CURRENT` and call `requestLocationPermissionIfNeeded()` + `MediaSessionRepository.refreshSessions()`; bump `CURRENT_ONBOARDING_VERSION` and add new steps with higher `sinceVersion` when a future update introduces new permissions — do not re-show completed steps
- `OnboardingWizard` root must be `Surface(color = OledBlack)` not bare `Box(background)` — same `LocalContentColor` black-on-black bug as `SettingsContent`; title/body `Car*Text` invisible without Surface; Button labels still render because Button sets its own content color

## Launcher Mode (HOME role)

- **Navigation App Mode** default: `MainActivity` intent-filter is LAUNCHER only; `LauncherModeAlias` (HOME+DEFAULT) `android:enabled="false"` in manifest — enable via Settings **Launcher Mode** + `MainActivity.applyLauncherMode()` / `PackageManager.setComponentEnabledSetting(..., DONT_KILL_APP)`
- `LauncherPreferences.isLauncherMode` default false; toggled in `LauncherViewModel.toggleLauncherMode()`; restored in `onCreate()` before UI
- Launcher Mode home-button fix: `setComponentEnabledSetting` alone does NOT prompt Android to switch default home — must explicitly request home role after enabling alias; `LauncherModeAlias` requires `android:label="@string/app_name"` or it appears blank in pickers
- `promptSetAsDefaultHome()` must use `window.decorView.postDelayed(200ms)` before showing the prompt — PackageManager needs a tick to register the newly enabled alias
- Do NOT fire `Intent(ACTION_MAIN) + CATEGORY_HOME` to prompt the home picker — on API 35 (Pixel/AOSP) this either redirects to the current default launcher or routes back into `singleTask` MainActivity and disrupts MapLibre, causing a crash
- Home role prompt in `MainActivity`: register `homeRoleRequestLauncher = registerForActivityResult(StartActivityForResult())` as a field (not inside a method); on API 29+ check `roleManager.isRoleAvailable(ROLE_HOME) && !isRoleHeld(ROLE_HOME)` then `homeRoleRequestLauncher.launch(createRequestRoleIntent(ROLE_HOME))`; fallback to `startActivity(Intent(Settings.ACTION_HOME_SETTINGS))` wrapped in `try/catch ActivityNotFoundException`
- Call `promptSetAsDefaultHome()` only from the toggle callback (`onToggleLauncherMode`) when `isLauncherMode` becomes true — NOT from `onCreate` restore path, or it opens the settings screen on every boot

## App update prompts

- App update check: `AppUpdateRepository` uses GitHub Releases API (`api.github.com/repos/kyuusanq3/mix-auto/releases/latest`) with `Accept: application/vnd.github+json`; compares `tag_name` to `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` via `isNewerVersion()` — do not require a `version.json` release asset; APK download stays at `releases/latest/download/mix-auto.apk`
- Auto-update launch prompts: `AppUpdatePrompts.kt` overlay in `DashboardScreen` weighted content `Box` (`zIndex(3f)`); bottom `SnackbarHost` for **Checking only** (`SnackbarDuration.Indefinite`, `88.dp` bottom inset above shortcut dock); **Downloading** uses persistent `AppUpdateDownloadBanner` Surface (not dismiss/re-show Snackbar — `downloadApk` fires progress every buffer read); throttle progress to 1% steps in `AppUpdateViewModel.downloadUpdate()`; top `Surface` banners for download/install — Download+Later / Install+Later
- `AppUpdateViewModel.checkForUpdate(autoPrompt: Boolean = false)` — boot `MainActivity` uses `autoPrompt=true` → sets `showDownloadOffer` on `Available`; Settings manual check uses default `false` (inline `AppUpdateSection` only)
- `showDownloadOffer` / `showInstallOffer` `StateFlow`s + `dismissDownloadOffer()` / `dismissInstallOffer()`; `downloadUpdate()` clears download offer and sets `showInstallOffer` on `ReadyToInstall`; dismissed download offer re-shows only on next cold-start auto-check — Settings still has download/install buttons
- Defer boot update check until onboarding done: `MainActivity` holds activity-scoped `appUpdateViewModel`; call `checkForUpdate(autoPrompt=true)` in `OnboardingWizard.onComplete` when wizard shown, else immediately after `setContent`
- `launchApkInstall()`: API 26+ when `!packageManager.canRequestPackageInstalls()` open `Settings.ACTION_MANAGE_UNKNOWN_APP_SOURCES` for package before install intent
- **Boot update auto-prompt:** `checkForUpdate(autoPrompt=true)` only when `savedInstanceState == null` in `MainActivity`; `AppUpdateViewModel.bootAutoCheckDone` prevents repeat per process; `AppUpdatePrompts` uses `rememberSaveable` for checking snackbar
